			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7E20000000000009"]
			description: [
				"&eTreated Wood&r is IE's universal building material - creosote-soaked planks that resist weather and form the frame of nearly every multiblock you'll build."
				""
				"Creosote comes out of the Coke Oven, and the Coke Oven needs treated wood scaffolding to be worth running, so expect to bootstrap the first batch by hand. That circularity is deliberate."
			]
			icon: "immersiveengineering:treated_wood_horizontal"
			id: "7E2000000000000A"
			rewards: [{
				id: "7E2000000000010C"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 30
			}]
			subtitle: "&7The frame of everything"
			tasks: [{
				count: 16L
				id: "7E2000000000020A"
				item: "immersiveengineering:treated_wood_horizontal"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "&6Treated Wood"
			x: -6.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7E2000000000000A"]
			description: [
				"Your first real multiblock. Twenty-seven &eCoke Bricks&r in a 3x3x3, hit one face with the hammer, and it becomes a &eCoke Oven&r."
				""
				"It turns coal into &eCoal Coke&r (a better fuel than coal) and drips &eCreosote Oil&r as a by-product - which is exactly what treated wood needs. The loop closes here."
			]
			icon: "immersiveengineering:cokebrick"
			id: "7E2000000000000B"
			rewards: [{
				id: "7E2000000000010D"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 50
			}]
			shape: "gear"
			subtitle: "&7Twenty-seven bricks and a hammer"
			tasks: [{
				count: 27L
				id: "7E2000000000020B"
				item: "immersiveengineering:cokebrick"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "&6The Coke Oven"
			x: -4.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7E2000000000000B"]
			description: [
				"Same idea, hotter. Twenty-seven &eBlast Bricks&r make an &eImprovised Blast Furnace&r, which turns iron plus coal coke into &eSteel&r."
				""
				"Steel is the gate to the rest of IE - the excavator, the arc furnace, the heavy machines all want it. It also feeds plenty of other mods in this pack that accept the common steel tag."
			]
			icon: "immersiveengineering:blastbrick"
			id: "7E2000000000000C"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "7E2000000000010E"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 60
				}
				{
					id: "7E2000000000010F"
					type: "random"
				}
			]
			subtitle: "&7Steel, the hard way"
			tasks: [{
				count: 27L
				id: "7E2000000000020C"
				item: "immersiveengineering:blastbrick"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "&6The Blast Furnace"
			x: -2.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7E2000000000000A"]
			description: [
				"IE does not use cables in the usual sense. It strings &eWire&r between &eConnectors&r, in visible sagging lines you can see across the island."
				""
				"Place an &eLV Connector&r on a generator and another on a machine, then right-click both with a &eCopper Wire Coil&r. The wire physically spans the gap."
				""
				"&7Wires have real transfer limits and lose energy over distance, and an uninsulated wire will hurt you if you touch it. This is a feature."
			]
			icon: "immersiveengineering:wirecoil_copper"
			id: "7E2000000000000D"
			rewards: [{
				id: "7E20000000000110"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 40
			}]
			subtitle: "&7Power you can actually see"
			tasks: [
				{
					count: 4L
					id: "7E2000000000020D"
					item: "immersiveengineering:wirecoil_copper"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					count: 4L
					id: "7E2000000000021D"
					item: "immersiveengineering:connector_lv"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			title: "&6Wires and Connectors"
			x: -6.0d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7E2000000000000D"]
			description: [
				"IE's early power is refreshingly low-tech: a &eWindmill&r or a &eWatermill&r bolted to a &eDynamo&r, generating quietly forever with no fuel at all."
				""
				"Perfect for a skyblock, where you have nothing but open air in every direction. Put a windmill high and unobstructed and it will outproduce anything you can feed coal into at this stage."
				""
				"An &eLV Capacitor&r buffers the output so the lulls don't stall your machines."
			]
			icon: "immersiveengineering:windmill"
			id: "7E2000000000000E"
			rewards: [{
				id: "7E20000000000111"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 50
			}]
			subtitle: "&7Free power, forever, in open sky"
			tasks: [
